      "text": "$\\mathrm{I}$ is linear function in ' $\\mathrm{a}$ '",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "I does not depend on ' $a$ '",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$0     < \\mathrm{I} < \\mathrm{a}^{2}+1$ where $\\mathrm{I}$ depends on ' $\\mathrm{a}$ '",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\mathrm{I}$ is quadratic function in ' $\\mathrm{a}$ '",
      "is_correct": false
